    en: ["sutra-tableau zones, central niches, coffered ceilings, or continuous narratives selected by cave and date rather than merged into one wall template", "line drawing, flat color, shading, sculptural volume, and ornament varying by period and workshop", "azurite, malachite, vermilion, ochre, lead white, and altered colors distinguished between original pigment and present condition", "soft lateral cave illumination revealing mural and sculpture without replacing real values with invented golden radiance", "earthen mural grounds, mineral and organic color, wood-armature clay sculpture, soot, salts, losses, and documented conservation traces", "show only verifiable cartouches, donor inscriptions, or scripture; never fabricate Sanskrit, Chinese characters, or decorative sacred text"]
